+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 A `.prettierrc.json` and a `.prettierrc.toml` written with a leading UTF-8 BOM load to the same object as without it (tests/unit/config-loader.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 A package.json, `.prettierrc`, `.prettierrc.yml` and `.prettierrc.json5` written with a leading BOM load to the same object as without it (tests/unit/config-loader.js) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 One BOM helper shared by the formatter and the config reader (src/utilities/bom.js, src/main/core.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 `readFile` drops a leading BOM when asked, and the config loaders pass that through (src/utilities/read-file.js, src/config/prettier-config/loaders.js, src/config/prettier-config/load-config.js)
+- [ ] 2.3 Changelog entry (changelog_unreleased/api/20127.md)
